        "feature":"feature calt {\n# GSUB feature: Contextual Alternates\n# Lookups: 5\n\n  sub [Kacyr K R Zhecyr] A' by A.alt1;\n  sub [Kacyr K R Zhecyr] Acyr' by A.alt1;\n  sub A' [Yacyr Zhecyr] by A.alt2;\n  sub Kacyr Acyr' lookup calt_2 Yacyr;\n  sub Zhecyr' Decyr by Zhecyr.alt;\n  sub Kacyr' Decyr by Kacyr.alt;\n  sub Decyr Yacyr' by Yacyr.alt;\n  sub Tsecyr Yacyr' by Yacyr.alt;\n  sub Shchacyr Yacyr' by Yacyr.alt;\n  sub Zhecyr' Yacyr by Zhecyr.alt;\n  sub Zhecyr.alt Yacyr by Yacyr.alt;\n  sub Kacyr' Yacyr by Kacyr.alt;\n  sub Kacyr.alt Yacyr by Yacyr.alt;\n  sub @calt2 [Elcyr Ljecyr]' lookup calt_2;\n  sub @calt' lookup calt_7 @calt;\n  sub A.alt2 @calt' lookup calt_8;\n  sub @calt' lookup calt_9 [M Emcyr];\n  sub [M Emcyr]' @calt by [Emcyr.alt2 M.alt2];\n  sub [M Emcyr]' [Elcyr Ljecyr] by [Emcyr.alt2 M.alt2];\n  sub [M Emcyr]' Zhecyr by [Emcyr.alt2 M.alt2];\n  sub K @calt' lookup calt_10;\n  sub R @calt' lookup calt_10;\n  sub Kacyr @calt' lookup calt_10;\n  sub Zhecyr @calt' lookup calt_10;\n  sub @calt' lookup calt_11 Yacyr;\n  sub @calt' lookup calt_11 Zhecyr;\n  sub @calt' lookup calt_11 Decyr;\n  sub @calt' lookup calt_11 [Elcyr Ljecyr];\n  sub @calt' lookup calt_11 [N Nacute Ncaron Ntilde Ncommaaccent];\n  sub @calt' lookup calt_11 [Z Zcaron Zdotaccent Zacute];\n  sub [arrowleft arrowright]' [arrowleft arrowright] by [arrowleft.alt1 arrowright.alt1];\n  sub [arrowleft arrowright]' [endash emdash] by [arrowleft.alt1 arrowright.alt1];\n  sub [arrowleft.alt1 arrowright.alt1] [arrowleft arrowright]' by [arrowleft.alt2 arrowright.alt2];\n  sub [endash emdash] [arrowleft arrowright]' by [arrowleft.alt2 arrowright.alt2];\n\n} calt;\n"
      }
